OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785057498
OL,3,CResidents staying put in village near
OL,4,CCairngorms wildfire criticise response
OL,6,FResidents in a village which
OL,7,Fauthorities are trying to evacuate
OL,8,Fduring the Cairngorms wildfire have
OL,9,Fcriticised the emergency response as
OL,10,Fbeing like "closing the stable door
OL,11,Fnow that the horse has bolted".
OL,13,FThose living in homes around Nethy
OL,14,FBridge were told to evacuate as a
OL,15,Fprecaution on Friday night, as the
OL,16,Fsituation around the wildfire at
OL,17,FCairngorms National Park deteriorated.
OL,19,FThey were later allowed to return home
OL,20,Flate on Saturday after Police Scotland
OL,21,Flifted a major incident declaration.
OL,26,@rD@LOUsD@^O]
