OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785057498
OL,3,CResidents staying put in village near
OL,4,CCairngorms wildfire criticise response
OL,6,FSuperintendent Judy Hill said there is
OL,7,F"no longer the immediate threat which
OL,8,Fprompted the evacuation of properties
OL,9,Fin Nethy Bridge".
OL,11,FThis is thanks to the efforts of "fire
OL,12,Fcrews, gamekeepers, contractors,
OL,13,Fpartners and many others over the past
OL,14,F24 hours", she said.
OL,16,FChanging wind conditions meant that
OL,17,Fthe fire, which has been burning for
OL,18,Fmore than a week, started to spread in
OL,19,Fa different direction.
OL,26,@oD@AOUqD@PO]sD@bOUvD@IO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/8
