OL,3,CResidents staying put in village near
OL,4,CCairngorms wildfire criticise response
OL,6,FLarge columns of smoke could be seen
OL,7,Fnear Nethy Bridge on Friday, but on
OL,8,FSaturday it was much less visible.
OL,10,FRichard Eccles has been living in
OL,11,FNethy Bridge with his wife Patricia
OL,12,Ffor 33 years, where they have run a
OL,13,Fguest house.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
