OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785057498
OL,3,CResidents staying put in village near
OL,4,CCairngorms wildfire criticise response
OL,6,FSpeaking to the Press Association,
OL,7,Fthey said police came to their house
OL,8,Fat around 10pm on Friday and presented
OL,9,Fthem with three options ` they could
OL,10,Feither stay, seek accommodation with
OL,11,Ffriends or family elsewhere or go to
OL,12,Femergency accommodation at the
OL,13,FMacdonald hotel in Aviemore.
OL,15,FThey said they decided to stay unless
OL,16,Fthe fire gets considerably closer,
OL,17,Fwhich most residents in the village
OL,18,Fappear to have done.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
