OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785057498
OL,3,CResidents staying put in village near
OL,4,CCairngorms wildfire criticise response
OL,6,FMr Eccles said: "We've got a camper
OL,7,Fvan and we're all ready and set to go
OL,8,Fat a moment's notice."
OL,10,FHe continued: "If it gets smoky, we'll
OL,11,Fgo."
OL,13,FA wedding was due to take place at
OL,14,FCastle Roy, which is near the village,
OL,15,Fbut Mr Eccles said this has had to be
OL,16,Fcancelled as a result of the wildfire
OL,17,Fevacuations.
