OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30806
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785057498
OL,3,CResidents staying put in village near
OL,4,CCairngorms wildfire criticise response
OL,6,FHe said the Scottish Government's
OL,7,Fresponse had been "poor" and a major
OL,8,Fincident should have been declared
OL,9,Fearlier, with military assistance
OL,10,Fbrought in to tackle the fire before
OL,11,Fit spread.
OL,13,FMr Eccles said: "It's a bit like
OL,14,Fclosing the stable door now that the
OL,15,Fhorse has bolted."
OL,17,FA large number of firefighters and
OL,18,Fother emergency crews have based
OL,19,Fthemselves in Nethy Bridge while the
OL,20,Foperation continues.
OL,26,@oD@SOUoD@XO]uD@QOUwD@RO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/8
