OL,3,CResidents staying put in village near
OL,4,CCairngorms wildfire criticise response
OL,6,FThe grounds of a local school were
OL,7,Fused for parking emergency vehicles,
OL,8,Fwith the village hall turned into a
OL,9,Frest area for teams to take breaks
OL,10,Fbetween firefighting.
OL,12,FSome residents brought donations of
OL,13,Ffood and water to show their
OL,14,Fappreciation.
OL,16,FThey included Francis Lake, who runs
OL,17,Fthe Nethy House cafe, and his 21-year-
OL,18,Fold son Tom, who brought a donation of
OL,19,Fbaked goods from the cafe.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
