OL,3,CResidents staying put in village near
OL,4,CCairngorms wildfire criticise response
OL,6,FThe Lakes decided to leave the village
OL,7,Fon Friday night but returned on
OL,8,FSaturday.
OL,10,FFrancis said: "It's really scary. But
OL,11,Fyou just have to hope it resolves."
